Option Strict On

' <summary>
' Strings of the viewer's own exchange entries (ticket 187 T-4): the "Add from an exchange server.." dialog, the per-entry groups of the
' directory view, signing out - the words of ExchangeEntryText. Modern only: the net48 project lists no exchange file.
'
' The product NAME is never in this table. The one proper name that appears is the program Share Manager, which is not translated.
' House style: ".." for an ellipsis, a plain hyphen, ё in Russian. Words that already exist in the viewer's tables ("Пароль:",
' "Подключиться", "Показать пароль", "Новый сервер обмена", "Отмена") are used from there.
'
' Columns after the Russian key: en, uk, de, it, es, fr, pt, ar, hi, bn, ur, zh.
' Никогда не ставьте «умные» кавычки в литерал - VB считает U+201C/U+201D разделителями
' строки; используются «…» и 「…」.
' </summary>
